# 0009-acceptance-display-strings.patch
# Baseline: v0.1.5, apply after 0001–0008.
# Fix UI observations in reviews/T10-acceptance-codex.md.
# Finite labels use an exact allowlist at display boundaries; dynamic values are
# inserted after translating a sentinel skeleton. User content and stored values
# stay unchanged. The font preview is a fixed local sample, never an agent prompt.
# Tests: plugin/__tests__/acceptance-display-strings.test.ts.
